From 7b72a34c149ad446b8639bcb779f56190ecf145d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gaurav-paul9 <paulgaurav9@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 10:57:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] graphics/FontController: Implement system-wide font coverage

Intercept font requests for standard aliases (sans-serif, sans-serif-medium, etc.),
GSF, and variable-* typography tokens, remapping them dynamically to the user-selected
font overlay. Repoint Zygote Typeface static placeholders in-place and flush caches on
configuration changes.
